to paint gold nuggets for him. The kid refuses, so the official puts the 
kid in jail. The kid draws a door in the jail, and escapes with all the 
other people who were wrongly jailed. The official captures the kid 
again, takes away the magic brush, and gives it to another artist, and 
tells the artist to draw a money tree. The artist does so, but the money 
tree doesn't come to life. The official realizes the magic lies within 
the kid, and frees the kid, gives the kid back the brush, and tells the 
